    value: "- Scatter appears on reels 2, 3 and 4.\r\n- 3 Scatters triggers Free Games."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_11_2
    value: '- 3 Scatters trigger 10 Free Games and pay x1 total bet.

